<title>USA: Alternative Resources forms alliance.</title>
<headline>Alternative Resources forms alliance.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLNSHIRE, Ill. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alternative Resources Corp said Friday it will form a marketing alliance with Unisource Systems Inc it says is designed to leverage the complimentary capabilities of the two companies.</p>
<p>Unisource Systems will be able to utilize its new partner's sales force of more than 150 as part of the marketing pact, Alternative Resources said.</p>
<p>Alternative Resources provides technical resource services.</p>
<p>Its shares closed up 1/8 Friday at 14-5/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
